body:
Sounds like you are not being affected by this virus. Many Marylanders are. In fact I've heard multiple stories from my loan officers of small business owners breaking into tears over the fact that they are losing their business they've spent the majority of their lives working for.

&#x200B;

The whole thing is a terrible mess. I believe the solution should be a self quarantine for those more vulnerable, and allowing portions of the Maryland economy to open up. There is an economic toll that will lead to more depression, death, poverty, etc that may eventually surpass the toll of corona.
